; ted-fail-returncode-lost (#357): every exit of outside ends in wb_exit,
; which loads wbmess into d0: the return code is lost.  TED alone from
; the CLI (under inject, which reports the return code) with
; graphics.library failing to open: the editor cannot start.  Correct: a
; return code other than 0; the original returns 0 (wbmess).
; @fixed #357
; @source none
; @command TEDAB:tools/inject openlibfail=graphics.library blitz2:ted
; @expect stdout "inject: openlibfail: 1 opens failed"
; @expect nostdout "inject: rc=0"
timeout 15
wait exit
